@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-02 Setup Project and Manual BOQ Entry

|Manager or QS (Web App)|
start
:Click "Create New Project";
:Enter basic project details\n(name, location, start and end dates);
:Assign Supervisors to project;
:Create Gantt-style schedule\n(planned start/end per activity);

|System|
:Display dynamic BOQ entry form;

|Manager or QS (Web App)|
:Manually input work item name,\nplanned quantity, unit, and rate;
:Click "Save Project";

|System|
if (Validation check: At least 1 Supervisor & 1 BOQ item?) then (Yes)
  :Save project to database;
  :Confirm project is active;
else (No)
  :Display error message\n(e.g., missing data);
  |Manager or QS (Web App)|
  :Correct validation errors;
  :Click "Save Project";
  |System|
  :Save project to database;
  :Confirm project is active;
endif

stop
@enduml